From 6c00735d901f01788fc0531152a9625222cd7e73 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Elliot Saba <sabae@valvesoftware.com>
Date: Thu, 2 Jan 2025 14:23:29 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 12/22] lepton: Add Process Observer to touch a file when our
 process exits

This allows lepton on the outside to wait for the creation of this
file to then shut down the container when the process inside of the
container exits.

Additionally if the process doesn't start at all within a configurable time,
we touch the same file to make lepton exit and avoid having empty containers
hanging around.

Change-Id: I7f552afded537308f690e656a5593c7306ea2bf8
---
 .../android/server/LeptonProcessObserver.java | 116 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../java/com/android/server/SystemServer.java |   6 +
 2 files changed, 122 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 services/core/java/com/android/server/LeptonProcessObserver.java

diff --git a/services/core/java/com/android/server/LeptonProcessObserver.java b/services/core/java/com/android/server/LeptonProcessObserver.java
